calcTaperingTrajectory(days, startG, targetG, reductionPct, dailyActual) – trajektorie s týdenní redukcí (weeklyFactor = 1 - reductionPct/100). Vrací trajectory[], savedG, savedKc (na základě defaultPricePerG), annualSavingsG/Kc.

9.10 Dopočet balení (lib/reconcile.ts)

Kandidátní dávky pro dopočet:

```typescript
function getReconcileCandidateDoses(pkg: Package): Dose[] {
  const pkgDoses = state.doses.filter(d => d.packageId === pkg.id);
  const unassigned = state.doses.filter(d => !d.packageId && d.strainId === pkg.strainId);
  const all = includeUnassigned ? [...pkgDoses, ...unassigned] : pkgDoses;
  return all.sort((a, b) => b.timestamp - a.timestamp);
}
```

applyReconciliation:

1. sumSelected = Σ vybraných amountG
2. diff = targetWeightG - sumSelected
3. factor = targetWeightG / sumSelected (pokud > 0)
4. delta = diff / selectedDoses.length
5. Pro každou vybranou dávku:
   · originalAmountG = aktuální amountG pokud ještě není
   · Pokud proportional: newAmount = oldAmount * factor
   · Pokud uniform: newAmount = max(0.1, oldAmount + delta)
   · amountG = newAmount, packageId = pkg.id, calibrated = true, calibrationDiff = newAmount - originalAmountG
   · Přepočítej cost, mitMg, sevenOhMg
6. pkg.status = 'finished', pkg.remainingWeightG = 0, pkg.finishedAt = now, pkg.calibrated = true
7. pkg.reconciliation = { date, method, targetWeightG, diff, factor, delta, doseIds, originalAmounts }

undoReconciliation: pro každou doseId v reconciliation.doseIds → amountG = originalAmounts[doseId], calibrated = false, smaž calibrationDiff, přepočítej cost/MIT. Pak pkg.status = 'active', pkg.remainingWeightG = initialWeightG - Σ assignedDoses.amountG, smaž reconciliation, calibrated = false.

